s season.\\n\\n## Analysis & Planning\\n\\n**Story Flow:**\\n1. **Immediate Impact**: KPI cards highlighting standout performers and league context\\n2. **Top Performers**: Who are the scoring leaders this season?\\n3. **Efficiency Analysis**: How does scoring volume relate to shooting efficiency?\\n4. **League Context**: What does the overall distribution of scoring look like?\\n\\n**Key Insights to Reveal:**\\n- Identify the top scorers and most efficient players\\n- Show the relationship between shot volume and accuracy\\n- Provide context for individual performance vs league norms\\n- Balance high-volume scorers with efficient shooters\\n\\n**Visualization Strategy:**\\n- **Bar Chart**: Clear ranking of top scorers\\n- **Scatter Plot**: Reveals volume vs efficiency relationships  \\n- **Area Chart**: Shows league-wide performance distribution for context\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"reportConfig\\": {\\n    \\"title\\": \\"Comprehensive Scoring & Efficiency Performance Dashboard\\",\\n    \\"timePeriod\\": \\"last90Days\\",\\n    \\"players\\": [\\"all\\"],\\n    \\"metrics\\": [\\"performance\\", \\"scoring\\", \\"efficiency\\", \\"shooting\\"],\\n    \\"visualizationType\\": \\"mixed\\",\\n    \\"charts\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\"type\\": \\"bar\\",\\n        \\"title\\": \\"Top 20 Scorers - Points Per Game\\",\\n        \\"xAxis\\": \\"player\\",\\n        \\"yAxis\\": \\"pointsPerGame\\",\\n        \\"series\\": [\\"pointsPerGame\\"]\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\"type\\": \\"scatter\\", \\n        \\"title\\": \\"Scoring Volume vs Shooting Efficiency\\",\\n        \\"xAxis\\": \\"fieldGoalAttempts\\",\\n        \\"yAxis\\": \\"trueShootingPercentage\\",\\n        \\"series\\": [\\"pointsPerGame\\"]\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\"type\\": \\"area\\",\\n        \\"title\\": \\"League-Wide Scoring Distribution\\",\\n        \\"xAxis\\": \\"scoreRange\\", \\n        \\"yAxis\\": \\"playerCount\\",\\n        \\"series\\": [\\"playerDistribution\\"]\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\"kpis\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\"label\\": \\"Top Scorer (PPG)\\",\\n        \\"value\\": \\"N/A (connect to data)\\",\\n        \\"format\\": \\"number\\",\\n        \\"trend\\": \\"up\\",\\n        \\"description\\": \\"Highest points per game this season\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\"label\\": \\"Most Efficient Shooter\\",\\n        \\"value\\": \\"N/A (connect to data)\\",\\n        \\"format\\": \\"percentage\\", \\n        \\"trend\\": \\"up\\",\\n        \\"description\\": \\"Highest true shooting percentage (qualified players)\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\"label\\": \\"Best Player Efficiency Rating\\", \\n        \\"value\\": \\"N/A (connect to data)\\",\\n        \\"format\\": \\"number\\",\\n        \\"trend\\": \\"up\\", \\n        \\"description\\": \\"Highest overall efficiency rating\\"\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\"label\\": \\"League Scoring Average\\",\\n        \\"value\\": \\"N/A (connect to data)\\",\\n        \\"format\\": \\"number\\",\\n        \\"trend\\": \\"neutral\\",\\n        \\"description\\": \\"Average points per game across all players\\"\\n      }\\n    ]\\n  }\\n}\\n```", "timestamp": "2025-12-09T16:40:01.451Z"}	\N	\N	7	cmhi2h5ta0000bkahrnqcv8m7	7f247e7a-b321-4d57-8b69-04367666ae64	2025-12-09 16:38:45.636	2025-12-09 16:40:09.794	{"variables": {"metrics": ["scoring", "efficiency"], "timeRange": "current_season", "components": ["kpi_cards", "charts", "summary_text"], "playerGroup": "all_players"}, "artifactType": "reports", "originalPrompt": "Generate a comprehensive performance dashboard for all_players with kpi_cards, charts, summary_text, focusing on scoring, efficiency over current_season"}
